 uch ensembles as the Philadelphia Orchestra\, Chicago Symphony Orchestra\
 , Saint Louis Symphony Orchestra\, National Symphony Orchestra\, Minnesot
 a Orchestra\, and major orchestras in Japan and Switzerland. In 1995\, Cu
 rnow was appointed principal trumpet of the Dallas Symphony Orchestra\, r
 ecording 14 CDs on the Delos label and appearing as soloist on several oc
 casions\, notably for Lowell Liebermann's Concerto for Trumpet and Orches
 tra\, and Bach's <em>Brandenburg Concerto No. 2</em>. In 2001\, he joined
