 dwide with the ensemble and recording on the Ondine and Deutsche Grammoph
 on labels. Well established as an educator\, Curnow has taught at the Uni
 versity of Connecticut\, Boston University\, Boston University's Tanglewo
 od Institute\, the Royal Academy of Music in London\, Temple University\,
  and the Curtis Institute of Music. He earned a Bachelor of Music from Te
 mple University.<br /><br /><strong>David Dzubay</strong>'s compositions 
 have been performed in the United States\, Europe\, Canada\, Mexico\, and
